# tools.list — the tools ~/dev/ruby/README.md lists, with their path and version.
# command | how to ask its version | what it is for
ruby   | ruby --version   | runs Ruby: `ruby x.rb`
irb    | irb --version    | the interactive prompt
ri     | ri --version     | the docs, offline: `ri String#split`
gem    | gem --version    | packages (gems): `gem install --user-install NAME`
bundle | bundle --version | a project's gems, from its Gemfile: `bundle install`, `bundle exec`
